#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Build and transpile a delay scan {#build-and-transpile-a-delay-scan}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Delay durations must be concrete values (they are scheduled in hardware "
"time), so we build one circuit per delay.\n"
msgstr ""

